{"id":"01a03fbf-57a0-71ff-96c7-3954e779f118","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.7.3.6","event_type":"updated","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"{\"id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.7.3.6\",\"title\":\"Zephyr: unprotect_response\",\"notes\":\"Already implemented\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"assignee\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"owner\":\"me@mark.atwood.name\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:46:13.944834Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-26T20:04:49.362552Z\",\"started_at\":\"2026-08-26T19:08:55.394585Z\",\"lease_expires_at\":\"2026-08-26T20:09:49.362552Z\",\"heartbeat_at\":\"2026-08-26T20:04:49.362552Z\",\"dependencies\":[{\"issue_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.7.3.6\",\"depends_on_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.7.3\",\"type\":\"parent-child\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:46:14.463152Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"metadata\":\"{}\"}]}","new_value":"{\"notes\":\"Implemented and verified RFC 8613 response unprotection. Fixed C nonce layout to S@byte0/ID@1..7/PIV@8..12 (matching header, RFC C.5/C.7, Python, Rust); no-PIV responses now reuse the exact request nonce and emit a zero-length OSCORE option; fresh-PIV responses use responder KID/PIV. Added separate replay windows for fresh response PIVs and accepted no-PIV request correlations, context/KID/KID-context validation, response-code validation, context-slot locking, and fail-before-output/state mutation on auth/parse/buffer errors. Added exact RFC C.7 and independent test/vectors/oscore_cross_exchange.json coverage for no-PIV/fresh-PIV, wrong request PIV, auth rollback, buffer rollback, duplicate replay, malformed/reserved/truncated options, and context mismatch. Gates: isolated Zephyr 4.1 qemu_x86 module build PASS; response-specific QEMU tests PASS; Python cross parity 12 passed; Rust cross parity 4 passed/1 ignored; cppcheck C23 PASS; git diff --check PASS. Broad existing OSCORE run still has three unrelated pre-existing failures: NVM retry-count expectation, stale EUI lookup expectation, and request-only roundtrip; response tests all green. Shared oscore_protect active-slot/NVM hunks remained hash-stable and were preserved.\"}","created_at":"2026-08-26T20:24:59.552131Z"}
